I now have a solid picture of the live attack surface. Key observations:

1. **Live cloud infra confirmed**: `api.jtl-cloud.com` (404 root), `auth.jtl-cloud.com` (Ory-based OIDC, OAuth flows, exposed JWKS), `hub.jtl-cloud.com`, `erp.jtl-cloud.com`, `account.jtl-cloud.com`.

2. **ERP Cloud page leaks config**: Sentry DSN, PostHog token, Zitadel client ID, internal service URLs (auth, account).

